  "prompt": "For each Voltmarkt channel, how many orders were placed in March 2025 (the UTC days of order_ts), how many units did they hold, and what was their revenue (quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur, over all their lines)? Return exactly four columns, in this order: channel, orders, units and revenue. Return one row for each channel. Any row order is fine.",
